guide forever/reputation/hydraxian-waterlords
title Hydraxian Waterlords Reputation
category Reputation
levels 60-60
zone Azshara
# Built from the Era-baseline reference data: Duke Hydraxis on his island off
# eastern Azshara and his chain (6804 Poisoned Water, 6805 Stormers and
# Rumblers, 6821 Eye of the Emberseer, 6822 The Molten Core, 6823 Agent of
# Hydraxis, 6824 Hands of the Enemy), with Dust Stormer / Desert Rumbler spawns
# for the kill quest. Nothing public shows Forever changing Hydraxis; this has
# NOT been play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# The poisoned elementals of Poisoned Water, the Eye of the Emberseer (Upper
# Blackrock Spire) and every Molten Core target have no spawn points in our
# data, so those objectives are `complete` goals with tips. Past the chain, the
# reputation comes from killing Molten Core's elementals and bosses, so the
# last steps track the standing (rep 749).

step Duke Hydraxis
  tip Duke Hydraxis stands on a small island off the eastern coast of Azshara; swim or walk the shallows out to him. The Hydraxian Waterlords start out Neutral. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  accept 6804
  accept 6805

step Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers
  zone Silithus
  tip Both elementals roam north-western Silithus; the Rumblers cluster a little further north.
  kill 11744 x15 quest 6805.1 @19.6,26.4
  kill 11746 x15 quest 6805.2 @24.1,13.9

step Poisoned Water
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Use the Aspect of Neptulon on the poisoned water elementals of Eastern Plaguelands, then loot their Discordant Bracers (12).
  collect 17309 quest 6804.1          -- Discordant Bracers

step Back to Duke Hydraxis
  zone Azshara
  turnin 6804
  turnin 6805
  accept 6821

step Eye of the Emberseer
  tip Pyroguard Emberseer in Upper Blackrock Spire drops the Eye of the Emberseer. This needs a raid group.
  complete 6821
  turnin 6821
  accept 6822

step The Molten Core
  tip Kill a Firelord, a Molten Giant, an Ancient Core Hound and a Lava Surger in the Molten Core. Every Molten Core elemental and boss also counts toward the Waterlords.
  complete 6822
  turnin 6822
  rep 749 Friendly

step Agent of Hydraxis
  tip Agent of Hydraxis needs Honored. At Honored, Duke Hydraxis hands out Aqual Quintessence, used to douse the runes in the Molten Core that summon Majordomo Executus; at Revered, the reusable Eternal Quintessence.
  accept 6823
  rep 749 Honored
  turnin 6823
  accept 6824

step Hands of the Enemy
  tip Bring the Hands of Lucifron, Gehennas, Shazzrah and Sulfuron from the Molten Core.
  complete 6824
  turnin 6824

step Hydraxian Waterlords to Revered
  tip Molten Core clears carry the rest. Bosses always count; in Classic, trash kills stop giving Waterlords reputation partway up, so late on the bosses do the work.
  rep 749 Revered

step Hydraxian Waterlords to Exalted
  tip Keep clearing the Molten Core until Exalted.
  rep 749 Exalted
